# Private repo for planning and tracking

This repo is public. Planning and tracking live in the private sister repo `pockethost/pockethost-support`, checked out at `../pockethost-support` (relative to this repo's root).

| What | Where (in `../pockethost-support`) |
|------|------------------------------------|
| Architecture notes | `MEMORY.md` |
| Roadmap | `plans/ROADMAP.md` |
| Backlog | `plans/backlog.md` |
| Feature plans, cost comparisons, research notes | `plans/` |
| Ops runbooks, dry-run output, server notes | `ops/` |

- Write new plans and notes there, then commit and push them in that repo.
- Never add plans, backlog, roadmap, internal notes or customer data to this repo, including at its root. `.gitignore` blocks the usual names, but don't rely on it.
- If `../pockethost-support` isn't checked out, say so and skip the planning updates instead of creating the files here.
